  "details": "Onboarding to VRChat at the moment toggles Holoport on by default.\nA user that doesn't know VRC well will not realise that this niche and buggy feature is extremely rarely used by players.\nA better onboarding experience would be to present the user with comfort options before they start, at first login.\n\n(Feel free to close this if the login experience has changed in the last couple of months)",
